    "productDescriptionProps": {
      "paragraphs": [
        "SEGLORA cover is made of aniline leather which is the finest type of leather of the highest quality. As it ages, it becomes softer and gets a darker tone and fine patina.",
        "Aniline leather has an unaltered surface that is treated with just a thin, protective coating. This gives it great breathability while retaining its natural look with marks that make each cover unique.",
        "The seat and back cushions provide comfortable support for your body and easily regain their shape because they’re filled with high resilience foam and polyester fibers.",
        "25-year limited warranty. Read about the terms in the limited warranty brochure."
